               PERFORM SQL-ACCESS-0003.
               PERFORM REFRESH-TAX-BAND-0004.
               PERFORM CHECK-HOUSE-TYPE-0005.
               PERFORM SQL-ACCESS-0006.
               PERFORM FORMAT-TERM-0007.
               PERFORM CHECK-REG-NUMBER-0008.
